==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Probopass|55}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*'''Triple Nose''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|POP Series 8|Probopass|4}} from the {{TCG|POP Series 8}} collection of cards.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

